window.products.push({"id":831010,"name":"Markdang 6 Pcs Acrylic Shelf Dividers (Shelves Less Than 0.8\" Thick) for Closet Organization Clear Closet Shelf Divider for Closets Book Shelves Purse","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71c8n1WmmdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【SIZE】- The size of the acrylic shelf divider is 11.8*8.3*0.15 inch, the base width is 1.2 inch. It is suitable to be placed on shelves which depth more than 11.4 inch, height more than 8.1 inch, and the board thickness less than 0.8 inch. If there is a cabinet door, note that the distance from the edge of the board to the inner surface of the cabinet door should not be less than 0.39 inch. 【Material】- Clear shelf dividers for closets is made from high toughness acrylic, not easy to break. Easy to clean, Just use a soft foam dipped in toothpaste to wipe down the divider. No chilly feeling in winter. 【CAREFUL WORKMANSHIP】- Curved corners, not only beautiful but also safe. There is a gasket on the base to prevent the shelf from being scratched. The clips of the base have good toughness and can hold up to 0.95 inch boards, but there will be slight cracks. For longer-term use, it is recommended that the thickness of the board should be less than 0.8 inches. 【SIMPLE INSTALLATION】- Because acrylic dividers for closet is clamped on the board, not directly glued to the board, it avoids leaving traces on the board, and can be adjusted at any time or placed on different shelves. 【Multiple uses】- It can be used in the wardrobe to organize clothes and prevent piled clothes or towels from falling; it can be used on bookshelves with a depth of more than 11.4 inch to sort books; it can also be used to separate bags to let The bag is beautifully placed on the shelf; it can also be used on the display shelf, so that each item has its own small space; it can also be used on the shelf in the kitchen to keep the dishes upright, saving space, and also control dry water.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71c8n1WmmdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Markdang","source_asin":"B0BYP3KN7Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-831010","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BYP3KN7Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BYP3KN7Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
