window.products.push({"id":831087,"name":"New and Improved HeyKITCH 9 piece Cooking Utensils, Silicone Kitchen Utensil Set, Stainless Steel handles, For Nonstick Cookware, Heat Resistant, Cook","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81u0PQYYnPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"COMPLETE 9 PIECE SET WITH IMPROVED ADHESION - These core kitchen utensils are made with reinforced silicone heads, which deliver flexibility and strength while protecting your cookware. This set also features stainless-steel handles that are made to fit comfortably in your hand to provide perfect control during cooking. Our utensils are a perfect match for any style kitchen whether modern, rustic, or anything in between. This set is sure to satisfy all your cooking needs. STYLE MEETS QUALITY - Silicone is valued by cooks for its durability and heat resistant properties. Our ultra-hygienic silicone heads are heat resistant up to 446°F. Safety tested and approved, our HeyKitch utensils are guaranteed to be 100% BPA free to make cooking safe. USE & CARE - The thick and smooth design offered by our stainless-steel handles make cooking comfortable and easy. Each utensil features a hook for convenient storage options. We know that cleaning is an important factor which is why our silicone utensil set is easy to clean. Food and grease will not build up or stain. To best care for your utensil set, we recommend washing by hand. NON-SCRATCH - Protect your high-quality cookware and kitchenware with our non-scratch silicone heads. Do whatever it takes to get every drop knowing that your pots and pans will not be damaged. Safe for use on all surfaces including nonstick, glass, and porcelain. THE PERFECT GIFT - Our cooking utensil set is perfect for the beginner cook or experienced chef. The broad range of kitchen tools makes it a great birthday, anniversary or house warming gift for those looking for an affordable and quality product.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81u0PQYYnPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HeyKitch","source_asin":"B07NY46PDN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-831087","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07NY46PDN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07NY46PDN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
