window.products.push({"id":831188,"name":"Iron Brothers Supplements Cyclone Cup - Shaker Bottle for Protein Powder, Secure-Lock and Tight-Sealed Lid for\"No Leak\" Protection, 22 oz, BPA-Free, C","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ndND1yXAL._AC_SL1156_.jpg","description":"The Cyclone Cup is No Ordinary Shaker Cup … It’s Better Proven to mix better than today’s leading shaker bottle — thanks to a revolutionary Cyclone mixing technology that blasts through and mixes up the toughest ingredients with ease. The Cyclone Cup is perfect for in the house, at the gym or anywhere else. Puts Other Cups to Shame Proven to mix better than today’s leading shaker bottle. The Cyclone is a stationary piece that moves against the flow of your ingredients, maximizing the stream of kinetic energy for superior mixing for any and all concoctions. Grab, Store, Go Rather than stopping by a convenient fast food joint, refuel your body and mind with a healthy alternative. When you’re heading out, all you have to do is add your favourite protein, supplement or meal replacement into the removable 6 oz storage capsule below the mixing compartment and you’re done. Later, simply unscrew the capsule, add the contents to your Cyclone Cup and shake. BPA-Free & DEHP-Free Concerned about harmful chemicals? The Cyclone Cup is a safe, 100% BPA/DEHP-free product, crafted from environmentally-friendly, non-toxic and recyclable materials. Cyclone Cup’s patented design is dishwasher safe. Literally Locks Ingredients Up Finally, a lid that won’t burst open mid-shake. The Secure-Lock Cap snaps firmly into place, preventing unwanted protein shake spills all over your shirt, kitchen, office or car. Cyclone engineers have perfected every last detail to ensure your Cyclone Cup remains leak-free, use after use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ndND1yXAL._AC_SL1156_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Iron Brothers Supplements","source_asin":"B07WHLWSVJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-831188","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07WHLWSVJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07WHLWSVJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
