window.products.push({"id":831247,"name":"60 Pcs Pampas Grass, Fluffy Pampas Grass Decor,17 Inch Natural Dried Pampas Grass Bouquet for Decor Bedrooms, Living Rooms, Dining Rooms, Parties and ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zpwpUdNwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"💐【MULTI-PURPOSE DECOR & UIQUE GIFTS】: Pampas grass decor represents freedom, romance and passion.The length of the pampas grass flower is about 17 inches,which can be cut to adapt to different sizes vases. The colorful vases decoration with this pampas grass, make the whole space more unique. It is a perfect choice for home decor, wedding decor, flower arrangement, party, gift, Mother's Day and Valentine's Day! 💐【DURABLE & FLUFFY & FULL】: Dried pampas grass is fluffy and soft, it is suitable for all seasons, does not wither and fade. Decoration in any space will give you a relaxed and comfortable feeling. After receiving the pampas grass, gently shake them a few times and leave them in the sun for a few hours over the next few days to make the feathers fluffy. Over time, they will become fluffier and pretty. 💐【PURE NATURAL & NO PUNGENT SMELL】: Unlike other bleached and dried pampas grass, our pampas grass is 100% naturally grown, hand-picked and naturally dried, non-toxic, harmless, non-pungent smell, no pollen allergy,no watering, which can save you money, time and effort. 💐【CAREFULLY SELECTED & DELICATE PACKAGING】: It is normal for natural dried pampas grass fall off slightly when taken out of the package. We have carefully selected high-quality pampas,the fragile pampas grass has been discarded and the remaining 60 pcs pampas grass has been carefully packed and shipped to ensure you receive the perfect bouquet. 💐【WORRY-FREE SHOPPING】: If the pampas grass bouquet you ordered is obviously defective or damaged, please feel free to contact us. We will try our best to make you 100% satisfied.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zpwpUdNwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"P TOPPSTORE","source_asin":"B09Q2P6BK8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-831247","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09Q2P6BK8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09Q2P6BK8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
