window.products.push({"id":831263,"name":"Air Fryer Parchment Paper, 200pcs 8.5 Inch Perforated Unbleached Square Air Fryer Liners,Steaming Parchment Liner, Parchment Paper for Air Fryer, No B","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51O+OEWmdbL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Note: Do not use parchment paper alone without food, press the paper down on the four corners while the food is being cooked. otherwise, it may cause burning by the heating core on the top of the steam fryer basket. Package included: 200 x 8.5inch air fryer parchment papers Features: - Made with food grade wood pulp and nonstick baking paper, prevent your food sticking on your air fryer. - 100% safe - Not bleached & non-wax & non toxic  - Lots of holes help to speed up the steam circulation - Heat resistant up to 230°C/450°F, safe to use in air fryer and will not curl or burn. - Clean up easily, keep air fryer free from food residue - Prevents pastries from sticking to air fryer - Speeding up prep time and shortening cleanup - Ideal for 8.6 to 9.6inch square shape air fryer or cake pan, or 10.5 to 11.5in oval shape air fryer(diagonal length), or 11inch round air fryer or metal steamer. How to use? - Put the paper down in the bottom of the pan after you pre heat. - Put the food on top of the paper so that the paper doesn't go flying up into the heating element and cause problems. Notices: - Please check the size and compatibility information on the image of the specific size you need. - Do not put the parchment liners in the basket and preheat your air fryer without food on top. They will float and burn and require the weight of the food to hold them in place. Please put it in the air fryer after preheating.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51O+OEWmdbL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MIUINCY","source_asin":"B094VG9LWR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-831263","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B094VG9LWR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B094VG9LWR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
