window.products.push({"id":831266,"name":"Wrapables Mini Chalkboard with Wooden Clip (Set of 12)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":4.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61GZ-q-ugqL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"These Mini Chalkboards are a fun way to decorate and label your possessions around the house. They come with a clip on the back for extra convenience. Use chalk to write a message on them, or put a pretty picture on it for decoration purposes. Here are some innovative suggestions on how to use these mini chalkboards: Use them as a card holder for table settings at a party or a wedding. Put the table number on the chalkboard and clip the menu or names of all the people reserved for the table on top. Glue a magnet to the back of the clip and use it as a refrigerator magnet to write reminders and to clip grocery lists and coupons. Use the chalkboard as a name tag and clip it to items such as your backpack or clothing. Organize your office area by using the chalkboard as a memo clip. Write important memos to the stacks of paper you clip together. Have the chalkboard serve as a photo holder by clipping a photo it and write an ad lib on the board. Then have the board stand upright on the ends of the clip or have it attached to your refrigerator via a magnet. Use the clip for baskets or candy jar displays. Write a message on the board welcoming people to take some candy. Warn others not touch your food by using the chalkboards as bag clips. You can writ \"don't touch\" or \" \"my food\" on the boards. The clips can be used on chip bags, pretzel bags and dried fruit bags, etc.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61GZ-q-ugqL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wrapables","source_asin":"B00E7YYZ7E","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-831266","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00E7YYZ7E","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00E7YYZ7E","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
