window.products.push({"id":831296,"name":"WENKO Portable Dehumidifier Cube Design, Compact and Rechargeable Dehumidifier for Bathroom, Closet, Bedroom, Garage, Covers up to 1400 Cubic Feet, 1.","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.26,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61uqSz3MOWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"WENKO's dehumidifier with a cube design in natural beige ensures less humidity and a comfortable climate. The modern dehumidifier integrates stylishly into any room and creates a visual eye-catcher with its modern cube shape. Especially practical; the dehumidifier can be used in many ways! In the car, motorhome or caravan, fogged or even frozen windows from inside the vehicle are a thing of the past. Like a magnet, the dehumidifier extracts moisture from inside the vehicle. The days of cold, damp basements and living rooms are also over. The dehumidifier intensively protects walls, furniture and textiles from moisture and unpleasant odors. It also prevents rust and ensures a pleasant climate in the basement, bathroom, bedroom and all other rooms, as well as in closets. The intelligent dehumidifier is ideal for rooms up to 1400 cubic feet. The dehumidifier contains 1.1 lbs of calcium chloride, which starts removing moisture from the room immediately after installation. The amount of water accumulated in the dehumidifier can be reliably seen at any time thanks to the integrated water level indicator and is proof of the effectiveness of the WENKO moisture remover. The dehumidifier does not require any electricity and removes moisture from the ambient air for up to 2 months. The suitable refills are also available.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61uqSz3MOWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WENKO","source_asin":"B0BJXLSBDK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-831296","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BJXLSBDK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BJXLSBDK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
