window.products.push({"id":831452,"name":"Anolon Advanced Stainless Steel Frying Pan / Fry Pan / Skillet - 8.5 Inch and 10.25 Inch, Silver","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QwmQTD6nL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Double up with an Anolon Tri-Ply onyx Stainless Steel fry pan set. The 8. 5-Inch and 10. 25-Inch frying pans are the ideal cookware for making casual dinners during the week or preparing signature dishes for Sunday brunch with friends. Leverage the versatility of the frying pans, in two sizes, to create a delicious onion and Sausage frittata, sear boneless pork chops to golden brown perfection when cooking with these professional-quality, pans. The cookware's durable three-ply construction features an aluminum core between layers of Stainless Steel for efficient heat distribution throughout the pans, and the long-lasting nonstick interior provides effortless food release. This cookware is compatible for use on all cooktops, including induction, and the polished Stainless Steel exteriors are easy to clean. The comfortable, stylish handles boast sleek onyx silicone grips over Stainless Steel, are dual riveted for strength and a confident grasp. Dishwasher safe for convenient cleanup and oven safe to 400°f, these durable frying pans and all the pots and pans from the Anolon Tri-Ply onyx Stainless Steel collection are a welcome addition to every kitchen. For a professional look and optimum performance, elevate your kitchen experiences by choosing the Anolon Tri-Ply onyx Stainless Steel frying pan set.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QwmQTD6nL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Anolon","source_asin":"B07FNCCP3Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-831452","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07FNCCP3Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07FNCCP3Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":831453,"name":"Kom Kom Miracle Zig Zag (Julienne Blade) Thai Multi Purpose Knife, Orange, 9.5 IN","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.94,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61vxwARR0SL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The nine and a half inch kom-kom Miracle knife (kom-kom #18) is a versatile blade and julienne peeler which is an intelligently designed utensil integrating a wavy edged blade and a 'V' shaped blade together into one single, convenient cutting tool. Though perhaps most commonly used by Thai people when making spicy papaya salad, Miracle knives have gained significant worldwide popularity as basic all-in-one garnishing tools. The multi-purpose blade rotates on a pivot so that the user can alternate between its many different functions. Dubbed as 'the Miracle knife' by virtue of its many different uses, it can shred vegetables, peel, carve, and core fruits, slice vegetables into undulated segments and divide fruit into zigzagged halves. The stainless steel blade is made to kom-kom's usual high standard, ensuring an excellent balance of sharpness and durability. It can be used to prepare Green papaya and cucumbers for a Green papaya salad in a matter of moments, saving time and effort and producing stunning results. 9.5\" length; Kiwi kom-kom brand (item Number 018); imported from Thailand. Kom-kom knives are produced to an exceedingly high standard, Boasting superior specifications to their cheaper selling variant, Kiwi. Known by reputation to be the very best knives that Thailand has to offer, kom-kom's designs are both attractive and practically suited for everyday use. Their stainless steel blades consist of a dense carbon alloy that is first heat treated and then carefully tempered to ensure long-lasting sharpness and unrivaled durability. Product features authentic kom-kom brand knife imported from Thailand an original invention with an adjustable blade can be used to peel, slice, core, julienne and divide into patterned segments high-quality hardened stainless steel blade dishwasher-safe plastic handle.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61vxwARR0SL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KOM KOM","source_asin":"B001F9VATA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-831453","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B001F9VATA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B001F9VATA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
