window.products.push({"id":831597,"name":"Halm Glass Straws - 20x 4 Inch Short Drinking Straws Reusable + Plastic-Free Cleaning Brush Perfect for B52 & Shot Glasses, Blowing Tubes & Parapherna","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71unhMHsKGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"THE SHORT ONE: the 10 cm (4 ichn) straw is ideal for your next B52, Gazpacho oder Flaming Flamingo. Also good as Blowing Tube. The small straw for the big drinking experience! QUALITY MADE IN GERMANY - We developed a special glass that produces extremely sturdy and stable straws that are also 100% recyclable. HALM glass straws can handle both cold and heat (from -40 F° to 392 F°) so they are safe for the dishwasher, microwave and even freezer. HALM straws are produced and packaged in Germany where all employees receive fair wages and full benefits. GOOD FOR YOU AND THE PLANET - Most glass straws are made of borosilicate glass, which can never be recycled. That's why we decided to develop a different, 100% recyclable, glass straw to truly reduce our footprint. Our straws, cleaning brush and even packaging are 100% plastic-free and therefore BPA-free, meaning no dangerous toxins in your body. Our production facilities are powered by solar panels. GLASS IS BEST - Remember how refreshing soda tastes out of an old-fashioned glass bottle? Only glass straws are completely taste-neutral, unlike metal, bamboo, silicone, paper, stainless steel or plastic. The rounded glass edges, specially designed for HALM straws, ensure safety and an extra-smooth taste. EASY TO CLEAN - Glass straws, just like your drinking glasses, can be easily cleaned in the dishwasher. Each set also contains a plastic-free cleaning brush for using at the sink or cleaning on the go.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71unhMHsKGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HÅLM","source_asin":"B07QKDNMJ8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-831597","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07QKDNMJ8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07QKDNMJ8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
