window.products.push({"id":831768,"name":"REALFLO 33ft Chimney Brush rod kit,Electrical Rotary Drill Drive Sweeping Cleaning Tool Kits with Nylon Flexible Rods (10 rods)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":71.31,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71DCfELIe8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Specification: 1.Material Bristle: Reinforced Nylon  2.Length: 100cm*10 (39 inch *10) 3.Rod :10pcs flexible rods  4.Diameter Bristle: 40 CM Application: Suitable for both metal flues and brick chimneys Suitable for pipes of different diameter and shape  Suitable for pipes of different length with the help of connecting rods Suitable for curved pipping Advantage: 1.Brush head High density & reinforced nylon rubber composite materials. Apply the most advanced injection technology. Hard wearing, and resist to high impact. Thus the brush head is extremely long lifespan. 2. Bristle Use helical nylon string, making it more durable. Have a special sharp edged rectangular shape, making the sweep more efficiency. Also it won‘t scratch the inner surface of the chimney flue. With the help of large rotational force, the bristles can remove even the most stubborn build up inside the flue or chimney. 3. Rod The rods are made from nylon, durable, elastic and chemically resistant. It has a great degree of flexibility, perfectly gets through those tough flue bends. It's single-pin thread push fitting, no loose during any direction of rotation(clockwise or anticlockwise). How to use: Step 1:Connect the rods one by one Step 2:Attach the bristle with rods Step 3:Put the brush into the flue. Step 4:Slide the rod into the flue. Step 5:Attached the drill with rod Step 6:Start cleaning chimney Our success is based on its employees’expertise, commitment, enthusiasm and their willingness to go the extra mile to move the company forward. The success story of Realyou continues with a vision of technology, hard work with dedicated and qualified teams having highly professional background, vision and innovation skills.Trust us, and we surely will not let you down !","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71DCfELIe8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"REALYOU","source_asin":"B06XR9X4R2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-831768","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06XR9X4R2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06XR9X4R2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":831769,"name":"EEX Portable Personal Air Cooler - Mini Table Air Conditioner Fan with Icebox, USB Desk Fan with 3 Speeds, Evaporative Air Cooler for Home, Office, Ai","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/5188dOoWwmL._AC_SL1002_.jpg","description":"【QUICK COOLING & 3 SPEEDS FAN】- Fulfill the visible icebox (300ml) with some ice or ice water, turn on this portable air cooler, and it will disperse the coolness within seconds. The personal air cooler has 3 fan speeds(3m/s/4m/s/5m/s). After the fan draws in hot air, the water in the water tank is separated into many water droplets from the centrifugal device, hot air and water exchange heat and cold to make sure that the wind blown is cold and comfortable 【4 in 1 Multi Function】 Small Desk Fan, Air Circulator, Portable Evaporative Air Cooler and Mist Humidifier in ONE, Pour water into a 300ml water tank, can moisturize skin and Air Humidification, keep away from dry air,you can also drop your favorite essential oil, enjoy your moist cooling summer. ➤ Personal Use: it is not designed to cool an entire room, but is intended to send fresh, cold or humidified air to about 3.2 feet maximum from where you need it, on you! 【ENERGY SAVING & ECO-FRIENDLY NIGHT FAN】- This evaporative air cooler and Humidifier Fan is Freon-free and eco-friendly. The personal air cooler can operate at low energy consumption(50 dB). Its power is supplied by the USB port(without wall plug). You can plug in computer, powerbank etc. With our personal air cooler which equipped with LED light of multi colors you can enjoy your cool and peaceful sleep on a hot summer night without concern about your bills. 【300ML Water Tank with New Filter】- This portable table fan equipped with the new release control like water based on wind speed. The new filter element adopts new material, has a strong water storage capacity and can be dismantled and washed to effectively keep the filter clean.（Soak the filter and refrigerate it would be cooler) 【PORTABLE & EASY TO USE】- With a portable and compact design(6.5\"*5.9\"*5.7\", 520g) , this USB air cooler can be easily moved from room to room. You can place the evaporative cooler in your kitchen, dorm, office or anywhere like, cool down your personal area(3-5㎡. Moreover, you could also take the mini air conditioner to outdoor. This portable air conditioner will deliver cooling, purified airflow – wherever you need it.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/5188dOoWwmL._AC_SL1002_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"EEX","source_asin":"B088Z22WLV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-831769","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B088Z22WLV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B088Z22WLV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":831770,"name":"Larcolais Ceramic Knife Set 3 4 5 6 inch Kitchen Knives with Peeler Chef Paring Fruit Vegetable Utility Cooking Knife Black Handle and Blade","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71uVFsA+ctL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Ceramic knives are a relatively new invention and always expensive. Basically, they're made out of a high-purity zirconium oxide powder that is compressed at very high pressures and heated in a furnace at temperatures over 2700°F. This results in an extremely-hard blade, nearly as hard as diamonds. SHARPNESS - The materials that make up a ceramic blade is very hard. It’s the second hardest material, ranked after diamonds. After it’s sharpened, it can keep its razor sharp edge and will not wear out. NO METALLIC TASTE OR SMELL - Ceramic material is not very porous at all. This keeps the blade from transferring odors from one food item to another. You can cut something spicy, give it a quick rinse and then cut something else. The spiciness won’t transfer to the next food item. SANITARY –The density of Ceramic blades is very high, and the blades have very little pores. Just like your face, the fewer pores there are, the less dirt and grime can get into the pores. A quick rinse in warm water can give your ceramic knife much clean than a thorough scrubbing on a metal knife. LIGHTWEIGHT - Ceramic material is very light weight. The lighter the weight is, the less strain on your arms and shoulders. You can rip through all you’re cutting like a pro. RUSTLESS -There is no metal, so there is never rust. Packaging Including: 1pc  x  6 inch Ceramic Chef Knife with Scabbard 1pc  x  5 inch Ceramic Utility Knife with Scabbard 1pc  x  4 inch Ceramic Fruit Knife  with Scabbard 1pc  x  3 inch Ceramic Paring Knife with Scabbard 1pc  x  Peeler","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71uVFsA+ctL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B07BBKC5TP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-831770","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07BBKC5TP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07BBKC5TP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
