window.products.push({"id":831805,"name":"Mesh Screen Food Cover Tents, 4 Pack Umbrella Screens to Keep Bugs and Flies Away From Food at Picnics, BBQ & More","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71PN6YfAhPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Perfect Choice for Your Delicious Food - 4 Pack Colorful Food Cover Are you hate of flies,mosquitoes and bugs around your delicious dishes? Are you tired of the ants crawling along the picnic table and spoiling your barbeque? Are you depressed when watching flies and other insects crawl on a meal you spent all day preparing for your guests?  Now It Is Time to Choose Popup Food Covers! Why it Can Keep Your Dish More Fresh?  ★【Description 】  Keep flies, mosquitoes, bees and other bugs away from your food with this Umbrella-style food tent. Bring this beautiful elegant lace umbrella with you to family BBQs, picnics and other outdoor events, and use them to cover buffet trays, desert platters or individual plates. The mesh material ensures a smooth air circulation and gives you a clear view of the items inside the umbrella.  ★【Features:】 ❤️Made with top-quality materials, including premium organza net and zinc-plated steel wire, these mesh food protectors are durable enough to guard your spectacular spreads for years to come. ❤️More Tight Mesh,it is better to keep your delicacies safe from all mosquitos, flies, ants, and even other small pests.  ❤️Easy Open and Close – Collapsible, umbrella-like design allows for quick setup and space saving storage when not in use. Lightweight materials for long-lasting use ❤️Bright Color with decant lace side,it is definitely wonderful decoration to your kitchen and picnic feast. ❤️The tent’s large size 16 inch x 16 inch can cover a wide array of plate sizes and beverages. ★【Specification】  - Color: Pink, Green, Blue, Yellow - Material: Net. - Size: About 16 * 16in(L*W).  ★【Packing List】  Pack of 4 Large Pop-Up Mesh Screen Food Cover Tent Umbrella Reusable and Collapsible Outdoor Picnic Food Covers Mesh Food Cover Net","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71PN6YfAhPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wild Tribe","source_asin":"B07DHH9J5V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-831805","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07DHH9J5V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07DHH9J5V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
