window.products.push({"id":831914,"name":"Holy Land Market Abstract Style Collectible Christmas Holiday Natural - Lacquer Free - Nativity Figurines Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":60.63,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71u1oB1VaRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Nine Piece Nativity scene figures hand-carved in the new and modern style (Abstract). Figures range in height from 3 to 5 inches tall. Very smooth and beautiful art work by a very special person and Christian in Bethlehem. Set includes Baby Jesus and Manger, Mar, Joseph, Shepherd, Sheep and 3 Magi Kings Figures are not finished with Lacquer and left Natural. To add to beauty of the Set if needed, you can treat it with a drop of olive oil wipe once a while and all lines ( veins of olive wood ) will show Hand-carved in Bethlehem in a small home factory. Supports fair trade in the Bethlehem area. Thank you so much. *** Comes packaged with Certificate and Lord's Prayer gift Card and the Nativity Story booklet ( descriptive and pictorial small booklet of the Nativity story )","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71u1oB1VaRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Holy Land Market","source_asin":"B0BNLVF3PL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-831914","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BNLVF3PL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BNLVF3PL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":831915,"name":"Casafield Organic Bamboo Cheese Board and Knife Gift Set with Removable Slate Cheese Plate - Charcuterie Platter Wooden Serving Tray with Hidden Snack","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":28.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81U1Q4UagDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Cheese board & cutlery gift set: This high-quality set includes a bamboo cheese board and four stainless steel serving utensils, slate cheese plate, and two removable slide-out snack trays. Our cheese board is the ideal gift for any occasion, including weddings, bridal shower, Mother’s Day, birthdays, housewarming, and more! Superior craftsmanship: Our bamboo charcuterie board and cutlery set feature a beautiful, natural bamboo look. The overall size of this oversized board is 14.25\" x 14.25\" x 1.5\". The center serving surface measures 9.5\" x 9.5\" and includes a 7.5\" x 7.5\" slate cheese plate. A large, deep outer rim surrounds the serving surface for displaying crackers, olives, meats, and cheese. Hidden snack trays: On either end of this versatile cheese board, conveniently placed removable snack trays are nested on the bottom of the bamboo cheese board frame. These snack trays add extra space for chips, nuts, and crackers. 4 Stainless steel utensils: Hidden within the convenient slide-out trays, you will find four stainless steel cheese serving utensils. Each of these serving utensils, used for slicing and spreading cheese, feature a matching bamboo handle. Organic bamboo: Crafted from organic \"Moso\" bamboo, this premium, sustainable all-natural wood is durable and beautiful. Cheese board is formaldehyde-free, BPA-free, with no chemicals. This eco-friendly material is naturally non-porous and resists knife scarring. Bamboo is a healthy alternative to other hardwood boards.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81U1Q4UagDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Casafield","source_asin":"B086676S3W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-831915","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B086676S3W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B086676S3W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
