window.products.push({"id":831937,"name":"IINTALENCE ART London Wall Art Decor, Vintage Tower Bridge Landmark Gray Print on Canvas. 18x26in Travel Gift Picture Home Decor. Unique Office, Livin","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":63.65,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91eYj5BqKlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Intalence Art. Artistic Discovery Redefined. About us. We believe that art should be for the many, not the few, and that means more than just your ability to buy a piece that brings your chosen space to life. It means that with Intalence Art anyone from any corner of the world can showcase their talent to a global audience. Our passion is to discover, develop, and display the best artwork , graphic illustrations from all over the world. It’s an ambitious project, but one that will unleash the creativity of inspired individuals all around the globe. For the Art Lovers. We’re art lovers just like you, which means we know a stunning visual when we see one. The second part of our journey focuses on making quality art accessible to everyone who wants to add a premium quality piece to their home. Decorate your home, office, or personal living space with a powerful and beautiful wall print from Intalence Art. Quality is our passion. Your Art deserves the best! There are a lot of low-priced prints out there but when it comes to your favorite wall art, quality canvas prints are important. We don’t cut corners on quality. Our formula is a combination of premium materials + top-of-the-line professional equipment and handcrafted work. 100% Satisfaction Guaranteed. You will absolutely love your print or if for any reason you are not completely satisfied, please contact our customer service team within 48 hours and we will be happy to answer your questions. Product Details Exclusive \"Vintage London England\" Travel Great Britain Canvas Wall Art Decor Exclusive \"Vintage London England\" Travel Great Britain Canvas Wall Art Decor Industry leading technology Industry leading technology Premium Wood Frame Premium Wood Frame Rich, Vibrant Colors Rich, Vibrant Colors Easy to Hang and Display Easy to Hang and Display Our products are Proudly Made In USA Our products are Proudly Made In USA Please note that due to different monitor color settings, actual canvas print colors may be slightly different from the product image.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91eYj5BqKlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"INTALENCE ART","source_asin":"B08FZNYJL8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-831937","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08FZNYJL8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08FZNYJL8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":831938,"name":"Zen Earth Inspired Wooden Recipe Box for 4\"x6\" Index Recipe Cards, Handcrafted Pine Wood Kitchen Storage Chest with Card Holder Grooves (200 Card Capa","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718IUc3ZLuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Perfect Way to Preserve Family Recipes +You can get rid of the old shoebox your grandmother used to keep your family's secret recipes in. This natural unfinished pine wood (6.7\" Length X 4.2\" Width X 5.2\" Height) kitchen recipe box can fit 200+ 4x6\" recipe cards, category dividers, and a clear card protector. This timeless chest will add charm and character to your kitchen. *This box does NOT come with recipe cards. Purchase separately and fill to your liking :) Unfinished for Beauty and Utility +Designed and built from scratch for keeping your precious recipes dry and organized, this well-constructed, beautiful box fits all your recipe cards, tabs, and dividers, and is truly a marvel to look at. Besides its sturdy lid, high quality corner protectors, and smart inclined design, it also features 3 differently sized, innovative patent pending grooves you can use as recipe card holders! Premium Quality you can Trust +When it comes to our family recipe boxes, we firmly believe there's no room for cutting corners. That's why we make a point of using nothing but gorgeous, natural, unfinished, sustainable pine wood — known for its beautiful and strong feeling — as well as heavy duty hinges and clasps, careful handcrafting techniques, and strict quality control! Useful Gift Idea +Are you looking for a nice and thoughtful gift for one of your kitchen-savvy friends or family? In that case, bear in mind that this handcrafted recipe box is more than just any old box; it's a chance to start a family tradition, and pass down secret recipes to the next generation. Woman and Family Owned +At Zen Earth, we're a small, family owned business that believes in tradition, and we are very proud of our handcrafted luxury cooking recipe boxes. After all, they're what we use ourselves, preparing a family legacy for our children and grandchildren! That's why we're happy to provide you with all the support and assistance you need concerning these wonderful recipe boxes, including a 100% satisfaction guarantee!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718IUc3ZLuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Zen Earth Inspired","source_asin":"B0BP5MKHZ4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-831938","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BP5MKHZ4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BP5MKHZ4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
